		(property "Note" "Pull-up so Q3/Q4 gates are defined before firmware runs. The boost is now always-on, so VOUT_3V3 is live the instant the cell goes in while the nRF GPIO is still high-Z - without this both load switches would float at boot. Mirrors R5's role for Q2. Q4's source is BAT_RAW (< 3.3V) so its Vgs stays >= 0 = off."
			(at 0 0 180)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
