		(property "Note" "Bulk reservoir for SENSOR_3V3 so the rail settles quickly when Q3 switches on. SENSOR_3V3 decoupling. The rail is switched by Q3 and had NO local capacitance at all - every bypass/bulk cap sits upstream on VOUT_3V3. ROHM's BH1750 application circuit specifies 0.1uF on VCC and Sensirion lists decoupling as mandatory for the SHT4x, and the rail is now re-charged from zero on every measurement cycle."
			(at 0 0 180)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "7c4b5c9c-8b87-43d2-be65-840cc25f2b27")
			(effects
